DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The aaddmmccttss driver provides support for the Analog Devices ADM1026 temper‐
     ature sensor.  The device possesses internal and external temperature
     sensors, a variety of voltage sensors, plus fan RPM sensors.  These val‐
     ues are made available through the sysctl(8) interface.

